{"track":"python","category":"딕셔너리","level":2,"title":"가격 합계","desc":"<p>상품 이름 → 가격 딕셔너리 <code>prices</code>의 <b>모든 가격의 합</b>을 돌려주는 <code>total_price(prices)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def total_price(prices):\n    pass\n","solution":"def total_price(prices):\n    return sum(prices.values())\n","hint":"<p><code>d.values()</code> 는 값들만 돌려줘요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"total_price({\"a\": 1, \"b\": 2})","expected":3,"visible":true},{"call":"total_price({})","expected":0,"visible":true},{"call":"total_price({\"x\": 10.5, \"y\": 4.5})","expected":15,"visible":false},{"call":"total_price({\"only\": 7})","expected":7,"visible":false}],"id":"py-060"}